  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1019.03 Mounding Minimization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1019.03 Mounding Minimization. The length-to-width ratio for bed areas shall be increased in order to minimize groundwater mounding potential, increase oxygen transfer levels, and increase down-slope cross-sectional area.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36",
